<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>性價比高的顯卡推薦</title>
    <meta name="description" content="如果組電腦有需要購買顯卡的需求，並且對顯卡了解不多的話，可以參考這個網站的資訊，進而買到合適的顯卡。">
    <meta name="keywords" content="顯卡, 高cp值顯卡, 過渡顯卡">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        header { background: #333; color: #fff; padding: 1rem; text-align: center; }
        nav { background: #444; color: #fff; padding: 0.5rem; text-align: center; }
        nav a { color: #fff; margin: 0 15px; text-decoration: none; }
        section { padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; }
        .card-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
        .card-item { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; width: 200px; text-align: center; }
        h2 { color: #2c3e50; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>性價比高的顯卡推薦</h1>
    <p>推薦性價比高的顯卡，讓你買得精明、用得開心！</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#series50">50系列</a>
    <a href="#series40">40系列</a>
    <a href="#series30">30系列</a>
    <a href="#best-cp">性價比最高</a>
</nav>

<section id="series50">
    <h2>50系列顯卡</h2>
    <div class="card-list">
        <div class="card-item">RTX 5060 Ti</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 5070 Ti</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 5080</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 5090</div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="series40">
    <h2>40系列顯卡</h2>
    <div class="card-list">
        <div class="card-item">RTX 4060 Ti</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 4070 Ti Super</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 4080</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 4080 Super</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 4090</div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="series30">
    <h2>30系列顯卡</h2>
    <div class="card-list">
        <div class="card-item">RTX 3060 Ti</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 3090</div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="best-cp" style="background-color: #e8f6f3;">
    <h2>⭐ 性價比最高推薦</h2>
    <p>以下是目前最值得入手的選擇：</p>
    <div class="card-list">
        <div class="card-item">RTX 3060 Ti</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 4060 Ti</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 4070 Ti Super</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 5060 Ti</div>
        <div class="card-item">RTX 5070 Ti</div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p style="text-align: center; padding: 20px;">© 2024 賴柏安的個人網站設計專題</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
